WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.656
YouTube Downloader.

00:00:01.706 --> 00:00:03.630
Links in, music files out.

00:00:04.946 --> 00:00:08.546
Found a live performance you want to keep
as a music file?

00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:11.763
Paste the YouTube link and click Load.

00:00:11.813 --> 00:00:14.641
The app reads the title, artist, and
length.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:18.873
Pick Audio MP3 and a quality.

00:00:18.923 --> 00:00:23.297
128 kbps keeps files small.

00:00:23.905 --> 00:00:24.895
Click Download.

00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:28.965
The app downloads, converts, and tags the
file in seconds.

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:35.783
Here it is.

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:39.796
Named, tagged with title and artist, and
with the cover art.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:44.343
No sign-in needed.

00:00:44.393 --> 00:00:46.283
Get it from the link below.

